From eb25cba63e066c0d464b89939cab87b955a630c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ONYX <onyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:45:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dzn: name what a command list held when Close fails; check
 Reset results

Records the name of every D3D12 command-list call per command buffer (a
64-entry ring) and logs it when ID3D12GraphicsCommandList::Close fails.
Logs failed allocator/list Resets (a failed list Reset leaves it closed, so
the next Close fails with E_FAIL).
